### ==========================================================================
### DWBE STORE - ARCHIVO DE PRUEBAS HTTP (REST Client para VS Code)
### Extensión recomendada: "REST Client" de Huachao Mao (100% libre y sin registro)
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET / - Portada del sitio (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. GET /about - Información institucional y cuadro de roles (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/about

### 3. GET /items - Catálogo completo de productos (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items

### 4. GET /items?category=Periféricos - Filtro por categoría (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?category=Periféricos

### 5. GET /items?q=teclado - Búsqueda por texto (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?q=teclado

### 6. GET /items - Catálogo completo en formato JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/items
Accept: application/json

### 7. GET /items?category=Audio - Filtro por categoría (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?category=Audio
Accept: application/json

### 8. GET /items/1 - Detalle de producto por ID existente (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Accept: application/json

### 9. GET /items/9999 - Consulta de ID inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/9999
Accept: application/json

### 10. POST /items - Crear nuevo producto (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pad Mouse XXL Gaming",
  "description": "Alfombrilla de tela micro-texturizada con bordes cosidos y base antideslizante.",
  "price": 18500,
  "category": "Accesorios",
  "stock": 30,
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616440347437-b1c73416efc2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80"
}

### 11. POST /items - Error de validación de campos obligatorios (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -500
}

### 12. PUT /items/1 - Actualizar producto existente (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 49900,
  "stock": 10
}

### 13. DELETE /items/2 - Eliminar producto por ID (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/2

### 14. GET /ruta-inexistente - Error global 404 (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ruta-inexistente
Accept: application/json
